 "remarks": "Coastal charm meets everyday comfort! Three lease options: turnkey furnished at $7,500/month, all-inclusive unfurnished at $7,250/month, or standard unfurnished at $6,750/month. Standard lease tenants pay electricity and gas. Both all-inclusive options include electricity, gas, water, high-speed internet, pest control, garden maintenance, and snow removal. Enjoy Long Island Sound views in this inviting Colonial, ideal for corporate or extended-stay rentals. Walk to Veterans Park and SoNo's vibrant dining scene, or bike to Calf Pasture Beach. The SoNo Collection, local schools, and East Norwalk train station are nearby. Smart-home amenities include smart thermostats, Wi-Fi lighting, and exterior environmental and security cameras. The spacious living room boasts hardwood floors and a cozy fireplace, opening to the dining room with sliders to a private patio and level backyard. A separate sitting room with its own fireplace and water views offers ideal space for an office or additional living area. The renovated chef's kitchen includes stainless steel appliances, farmhouse sink, ample cabinetry, and breakfast bar. Upstairs are three bedrooms and an updated full bath. The primary bedroom has two closets and a private sun deck overlooking the Sound. A finished walk-up attic provides flexible space for a home office, guest room, or potential fourth bedroom. Basement includes laundry, storage, and access to the one-car garage. Enjoy coastal living with exceptional convenience!",
